# gomoku

> Play the classic 5-in-a-row strategy board game.
> More information: <https://manned.org/man/gomoku>.

- Start the game:

`gomoku`

- Move the cursor:

`{{<h>|<j>|<k>|<l>|<ArrowLeft>|<ArrowDown>|<ArrowUp>|<ArrowRight>}}`

- Select the cell:

`<Space>`

- Quit the game:

`<q>`
